{{Quote|Only petty criminals get sent to Wobani. No one from that sledge hole could possibly be that important.|[[Jory (Rebel Alliance)|Jory]] of [[Red Flight (Rebel Alliance)|Red Flight]]|<ref name="Battlefront">''[[Star Wars Battlefront]]'': Rogue One: X-wing VR Mission''</ref>}}
'''Imperial Detention Center & Labor Camp LEG-817''',<ref name="Rebel Rising">''[[Rebel Rising]]''</ref> also known simply as '''Wobani Labor Camp''',<ref name="Rogue One novel">[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story (novelization)|''Rogue One: A Star Wars Story'' novelization]]</ref> was an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[labor camp]] located on the [[planet]] [[Wobani]].<ref name="Rogue One" /> Many [[pirate]]s were sent there as the Empire cracked down on criminals in the Outer Rim.<ref name="Dawn">''[[Dawn of Rebellion]]''</ref> Around the [[time]] of the [[Battle of Scarif]], an [[HCVw A9 turbo tank]] appeared near the premises of the labor camp, used as a [[prisoner]] [[transport]]. This tank was carrying [[Jyn Erso]] as a prisoner. Erso was incarcerated there until being [[Liberation of Erso|broken out]]<ref name="Rogue One" /> by [[Extraction Team Bravo]] of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]].<ref name="Battlefront" />

